# .gitignore
**/.SECRETS**
!**/.SECRETS/.gitkeep

.git/*
!.git/config
!.git/hooks/pre-commit
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes

**/.tmp.drivedownload**
**/.trash**
**/.stfolder**
**/.DS_Store**
**/Thumbs.db**
**/desktop.ini**
**/$Recycle.Bin**
**/$Temp**

**/.obsidian/**
!**/.obsidian/appearance.json
!**/.obsidian/community-plugins.json
!**/.obsidian/snippets/**
!**/.obsidian/plugins/**

**/.vscode/**
